# Comments language

All code comments and JSDoc — **English only**.

- JSDoc on props / types / exports
- inline `//` and block `/* */`
- section markers in `types.ts`

Allowed in product language (not comments):

- UI copy in stories / tests / fixtures
- `Description.ru.md` / `Description.en.md` and other human docs (see `component-docs`)

## Style

Keep JSDoc short and consistent across primitives:

- `/** Theme inputs. */`
- `/** {Name} size. */` / `/** Visual variant. */`
- `/** Control state (our names, not RAC). */`
- `/** Own / chrome props (not from RAC|DOM). */`
- `/** Content slice for FormX. */`
- `/** RAC keys omitted because names differ from ours. */`
- refs: `/** Ref to the … (React 19 prop). */`
- stories: `/** Story wrapper for react-docgen-typescript. */`
